      <div>
        <table cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000; border-spacing: 0px;"> <tr> <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top;">(1)</td> <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;"> <div><ix:footnote id="ix_0_footnote" xml:lang="en-US">As of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, the current portion of the Company&#8217;s debt (i.e., becoming due in the next 12 months) included $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c130" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtCurrent" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-13237">20.0</ix:nonFraction> million and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c131" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LongTermDebtCurrent" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-13238">20.0</ix:nonFraction> million, respectively, of the balance of its term loan under the Credit Agreement and 2022 Credit Agreement.</ix:footnote></div> </td> </tr> </table>
