              <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify;">
                <div>&#8220;Paid Affiliates&#8221; are any Brand Affiliates, as well as members of our sales force in Mainland China, who earned sales compensation during the three-month period. In all of our markets besides Mainland China, we refer to members of our
                  independent sales force as &#8220;Brand Affiliates&#8221; because their primary role is to promote our brand and products through their personal social networks.</div>
              </td>
            </tr>

        </table>
